.TH CLRU_DECLARE_SCOPED 3 "2026-08-02" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
clru_declare_scoped \- declare an LRU cache with automatic RAII destruction
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <clrucache.h>

clru_declare_scoped(name, KeyT, ValT);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Like clru_declare() but attaches __attribute__((cleanup(___clrucache_destroy)))
so that the cache is destroyed automatically when the variable leaves
scope. Must be followed by clru_init() before use.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name  Variable name for the cache handle
KeyT  Key type
ValT  Value type
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Requires GCC or Clang (uses __attribute__((cleanup))).
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR clru_declare (3),
.BR clru_construct_scoped (3)
